(6036557, 887677, 105079, '<td valign="top">In an endeavor to be more active in voting I''m attempting to comment more and more.  I really dislike the selective color, even if it is nicely done.  I do like the over exposure on your hair and your dark shirt balances things out... I just don''t like the one-color thing.  Just out of curiosity though, is that your real eye color?</td>', 'In an endeavor to be more active in voting I''m attempting to comment more and more.  I really dislike the selective color, even if it is nicely done.  I do like the over exposure on your hair and your dark shirt balances things out... I just don''t like the one-color thing.  Just out of curiosity though, is that your real eye color?', '2010-06-02 01:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
