(6036616, 887627, 66515, '<td valign="top">Self portraits are always tough especially for things like focus. If your focus had been on your eyes this image would be great. It almost looks like the focus is actually behind you. <br/> <br/>The background is also quite busy and really draws attention away from your face. <br/> <br/>The pose itself works well and the composition is solid. The shirt you chose is quite complimentary and while quite brightly colored actually helps bring attention to your face.</td>', 'Self portraits are always tough especially for things like focus. If your focus had been on your eyes this image would be great. It almost looks like the focus is actually behind you.  The background is also quite busy and really draws attention away from your face.  The pose itself works well and the composition is solid. The shirt you chose is quite complimentary and while quite brightly colored actually helps bring attention to your face.', '2010-06-02 02:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
