(6037459, 887356, 32767, '<td valign="top">love it</td>', 'love it', '2010-06-02 11:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037473, 887732, 118045, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and composition, it look like a bench with a human head ;°D<br/>Anyway i think the light could be a little better...the clouds are too bright.</td>', 'I like the idea and composition, it look like a bench with a human head ;°DAnyway i think the light could be a little better...the clouds are too bright.', '2010-06-02 11:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037480, 886929, 113278, '<td valign="top">lol, love it.</td>', 'lol, love it.', '2010-06-02 12:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037490, 887561, 113278, '<td valign="top">This is just crazy cool to look at. Nice work.</td>', 'This is just crazy cool to look at. Nice work.', '2010-06-02 12:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037494, 886445, 87808, '<td valign="top">I can see this with a ribbon</td>', 'I can see this with a ribbon', '2010-06-02 12:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037499, 887632, 29777, '<td valign="top">Overall seems soft. My eyes are drawn to the overblown light coming in through the window. The lighting does not seem to fit the mood and posture of the subject. Perhaps exposing for the window light and using a fill flash would provide a sharper result with more contrast.</td>', 'Overall seems soft. My eyes are drawn to the overblown light coming in through the window. The lighting does not seem to fit the mood and posture of the subject. Perhaps exposing for the window light and using a fill flash would provide a sharper result with more contrast.', '2010-06-02 12:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037500, 886236, 29777, '<td valign="top">The face and glasses seem a bit soft. Considering the wonderful texture on the background I would expect the rest of the image to be tack sharp.</td>', 'The face and glasses seem a bit soft. Considering the wonderful texture on the background I would expect the rest of the image to be tack sharp.', '2010-06-02 12:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037505, 887677, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like high key shots like this. The only problem I have here is the eye makeup. My attention is drawn to the eye right away, which is good. The eye make up is lighter toward the bridge of the nose and the high key aspect makes it difficult to determine the border of the eye. This makes the eyes appear to move in toward the nose and appear cross-eyed. A little burning in that area or a little more make up in that one spot would improve this image for me.</td>', 'I like high key shots like this. The only problem I have here is the eye makeup. My attention is drawn to the eye right away, which is good. The eye make up is lighter toward the bridge of the nose and the high key aspect makes it difficult to determine the border of the eye. This makes the eyes appear to move in toward the nose and appear cross-eyed. A little burning in that area or a little more make up in that one spot would improve this image for me.', '2010-06-02 12:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037506, 887346, 29777, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting</td>', 'Love the lighting', '2010-06-02 12:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037508, 887080, 30861, '<td valign="top">Dang, Stephen... it''s TIME for your focusing lesson...</td>', 'Dang, Stephen... it''s TIME for your focusing lesson...', '2010-06-02 12:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037510, 887587, 29777, '<td valign="top">Too much contrast for my taste. The face is very close to the edge and in shadow.</td>', 'Too much contrast for my taste. The face is very close to the edge and in shadow.', '2010-06-02 12:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037511, 887597, 29777, '<td valign="top">a clever idea. I like the popped bubbles.</td>', 'a clever idea. I like the popped bubbles.', '2010-06-02 12:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037517, 887356, 17507, '<td valign="top">Hi Robert! I like the genial, paternal look for you, although you did pull off the slightly overcooked crusty HDR thing, too.</td>', 'Hi Robert! I like the genial, paternal look for you, although you did pull off the slightly overcooked crusty HDR thing, too.', '2010-06-02 12:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037518, 887080, 17507, '<td valign="top">You''re my hero</td>', 'You''re my hero', '2010-06-02 12:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037519, 886929, 17507, '<td valign="top">FTW.</td>', 'FTW.', '2010-06-02 12:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037523, 886806, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice tie!</td>', 'Great shot. Nice tie!', '2010-06-02 12:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037525, 887530, 17507, '<td valign="top">Strong portrait - great composition, excellent use of DOF, good pose and lighting. Only criticism, really, is the brightness of some of the highlights, namely on the hand, and to a certain extent on your face and shirt, too. If you were shooting in RAW, you could have output a darker JPG/TIFF and done a faux HDR to tone down the bright spots. In any case, strong image, and good luck in the final standings.</td>', 'Strong portrait - great composition, excellent use of DOF, good pose and lighting. Only criticism, really, is the brightness of some of the highlights, namely on the hand, and to a certain extent on your face and shirt, too. If you were shooting in RAW, you could have output a darker JPG/TIFF and done a faux HDR to tone down the bright spots. In any case, strong image, and good luck in the final standings.', '2010-06-02 12:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037526, 887719, 17507, '<td valign="top">Awesome pose and expression, great rhythm in the composition, pleasing full range of tones, good sharpness throughout, appealing sense of mystery created by--whatever it is you''re holding on to. Very nice work!</td>', 'Awesome pose and expression, great rhythm in the composition, pleasing full range of tones, good sharpness throughout, appealing sense of mystery created by--whatever it is you''re holding on to. Very nice work!', '2010-06-02 12:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037528, 886768, 17507, '<td valign="top">Fabulously surreal. Nice job getting the water to flow from the hose. I don''t mind the hot highlights on the shirt - the high contrast adds to the stark weirdness.</td>', 'Fabulously surreal. Nice job getting the water to flow from the hose. I don''t mind the hot highlights on the shirt - the high contrast adds to the stark weirdness.', '2010-06-02 12:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037529, 887164, 17507, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this on the front page. This is great. Perfect.</td>', 'I would love to see this on the front page. This is great. Perfect.', '2010-06-02 12:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037555, 886768, 38032, '<td valign="top">super deep  too bad you''re not more frail and pale  ;)  it might add the the macabre. Really great setup and nice post processing.</td>', 'super deep  too bad you''re not more frail and pale  ;)  it might add the the macabre. Really great setup and nice post processing.', '2010-06-02 13:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
