(6038490, 887623, 29009, '<td valign="top">Technically sound.  Nice touch having a similar (or same?) shirt on.  Yet, it seems like you were trying to send a particular message and I''m not sure I got it.  Unless it was sad, like your days of climbing Mt. Washington were over and you still have no one to share it with.  I''ll bump you up a point in case it was sad, at least you have a better score!  :)</td>', 'Technically sound.  Nice touch having a similar (or same?) shirt on.  Yet, it seems like you were trying to send a particular message and I''m not sure I got it.  Unless it was sad, like your days of climbing Mt. Washington were over and you still have no one to share it with.  I''ll bump you up a point in case it was sad, at least you have a better score!  :)', '2010-06-02 23:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
