(6038514, 887706, 29009, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to say this doesn''t look very peaceful.  It rather looks like an "Look how cool I am..."  MySpace profile photo.  <br/> <br/>Next time think about how tonal range and key adds or subtracts from your message.  From your title, I''d expect something mid-range or high key.  Low key images suggest a dark moodiness that contraindicates "peace."  Next, the eyes are closed; I''d have expected based on the title that the subject would have an unflinching gaze or at least the eyes open.<br/> <br/>Better luck next time.</td>', 'I''m sorry to say this doesn''t look very peaceful.  It rather looks like an "Look how cool I am..."  MySpace profile photo.   Next time think about how tonal range and key adds or subtracts from your message.  From your title, I''d expect something mid-range or high key.  Low key images suggest a dark moodiness that contraindicates "peace."  Next, the eyes are closed; I''d have expected based on the title that the subject would have an unflinching gaze or at least the eyes open. Better luck next time.', '2010-06-02 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
