(6039986, 887747, 49520, '<td valign="top">I find it distracting the way your arms are set. It doesn''t seem natural and is a cause for distraction (e.g. your right arm leaning on the chair and our left arm not seeming to know where it should be. Your arms are not conveying the same message as your head and body. <br/> <br/>The other distraction is the cropping of the feet. <br/> <br/>That being said, exposure, dof, lighting, contrast, and all the technical aspects of the photo are spot on in my opinion.</td>', 'I find it distracting the way your arms are set. It doesn''t seem natural and is a cause for distraction (e.g. your right arm leaning on the chair and our left arm not seeming to know where it should be. Your arms are not conveying the same message as your head and body.  The other distraction is the cropping of the feet.  That being said, exposure, dof, lighting, contrast, and all the technical aspects of the photo are spot on in my opinion.', '2010-06-04 00:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6039992, 887715, 49520, '<td valign="top">Too much of something can be a bad thing. I find the contrast excessive in this case. Is it because the image was initially over-exposed?<br/> <br/>I also wonder he effect my have been more dramatic if you also cropped out half of the face instead of part of one eye.</td>', 'Too much of something can be a bad thing. I find the contrast excessive in this case. Is it because the image was initially over-exposed? I also wonder he effect my have been more dramatic if you also cropped out half of the face instead of part of one eye.', '2010-06-04 00:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
