(6041370, 886836, 29009, '<td valign="top">Next time, try angling the glasses downward so the light isn''t reflected back at the camera lens.  One easy way to do this is to take the part that goes over the ears and bring it up toward the top of the head about 1/4 to 1/2 an inch.  Otherwise, it''s an interesting shot.</td>', 'Next time, try angling the glasses downward so the light isn''t reflected back at the camera lens.  One easy way to do this is to take the part that goes over the ears and bring it up toward the top of the head about 1/4 to 1/2 an inch.  Otherwise, it''s an interesting shot.', '2010-06-04 22:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
