(6041406, 886929, 112082, '<td valign="top">My second favorite entry. It would have been my #1 if the eyes were not so Photoshopped. I love this image. What a great sense of humor. Pose is hysterical and lighting is excellent. Seriously, look closely at the shadows in the belly button. Fades in ever so slowly. A perfect gradient.</td>', 'My second favorite entry. It would have been my #1 if the eyes were not so Photoshopped. I love this image. What a great sense of humor. Pose is hysterical and lighting is excellent. Seriously, look closely at the shadows in the belly button. Fades in ever so slowly. A perfect gradient.', '2010-06-04 23:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
