(6042174, 886537, 117559, '<td valign="top">Title is brilliant!</td>', 'Title is brilliant!', '2010-06-05 19:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6042329, 887634, 5822, '<td valign="top">I Like the simplicity of this portrait and the engaging, direct gaze but technically it looks like it''s been compressed way too much (jpg artifacts) and softened to the point where detail has been lost. Lighting is very good imparting a bright and cheery mood. Wtih the exception of the above, this is a very well done portrait.</td>', 'I Like the simplicity of this portrait and the engaging, direct gaze but technically it looks like it''s been compressed way too much (jpg artifacts) and softened to the point where detail has been lost. Lighting is very good imparting a bright and cheery mood. Wtih the exception of the above, this is a very well done portrait.', '2010-06-05 21:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6042336, 887721, 5822, '<td valign="top">An interesting and innovative portrait in the cubists'' style (?). I think I would prefer different framing with more room at the sides but I like it nonetheless. A technique that needs polishing but that has potential. Bravo to you for thinking outside-of-the-box and eliciting thought and emotional response in this viewer.</td>', 'An interesting and innovative portrait in the cubists'' style (?). I think I would prefer different framing with more room at the sides but I like it nonetheless. A technique that needs polishing but that has potential. Bravo to you for thinking outside-of-the-box and eliciting thought and emotional response in this viewer.', '2010-06-05 21:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6042356, 887715, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition a lot just not the harsh glare or over-sharpening as much. I think framing needs to include the entire eye of the peacock feather and a little more room around the subject''s eye. The glare is detracting from the similar colors of the feather and eye makeup.</td>', 'I like the composition a lot just not the harsh glare or over-sharpening as much. I think framing needs to include the entire eye of the peacock feather and a little more room around the subject''s eye. The glare is detracting from the similar colors of the feather and eye makeup.', '2010-06-05 21:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
