(6043002, 887238, 68947, '<td valign="top">I don''t really consider this a "portrait shot" but, it''s very well executed!  Must have taken quite a bit to get the focus right in the lighting condidtions.</td>', 'I don''t really consider this a "portrait shot" but, it''s very well executed!  Must have taken quite a bit to get the focus right in the lighting condidtions.', '2010-06-06 12:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
