(6043005, 886327, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really interesting as to why you chose the redness to your nose and mouth. :)  The look goes with the harsh processing! :)</td>', 'Really interesting as to why you chose the redness to your nose and mouth. :)  The look goes with the harsh processing! :)', '2010-06-06 12:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
