(6043008, 886191, 68947, '<td valign="top">I think the issue with this one is the lighting being a bit too harsh.  Flash or just a strong light source from above (given the shadow under your chin) and behind your shoulder.  I think that I might have cropped out much more of the background and perhaps, a tighter crop to get more just to your beautiful face and make that the focus of the shot.</td>', 'I think the issue with this one is the lighting being a bit too harsh.  Flash or just a strong light source from above (given the shadow under your chin) and behind your shoulder.  I think that I might have cropped out much more of the background and perhaps, a tighter crop to get more just to your beautiful face and make that the focus of the shot.', '2010-06-06 12:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
