(6043756, 886219, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yes, Grog believe. Grog is great self-groomer, tells you way to shave. You find sharp rock, flint good. Take fat from mammoth, or other large mammal killed in recent hunt. (Choose fresh one, or females not come near you) You rub mammal fat into beard to soften. Scrape with rock and wash in stream. You now handsome like Grog.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=887971" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_887971.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_887971.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_887971.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>You thank Grog and mark comment helpful.</td>', 'Yes, Grog believe. Grog is great self-groomer, tells you way to shave. You find sharp rock, flint good. Take fat from mammoth, or other large mammal killed in recent hunt. (Choose fresh one, or females not come near you) You rub mammal fat into beard to soften. Scrape with rock and wash in stream. You now handsome like Grog.  You thank Grog and mark comment helpful.', '2010-06-07 00:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
