(6047542, 887705, 61084, '<td valign="top">A really cool and nice shot Melissa. Too bad about the DQ, and I hope they at least gave you a good explanation of how the multiple exposure in camera can be used. Unfortunately it can only be used to increase the dynamic range such as an in camera HDR, but nothing in the scene or frame must change. Your movement through the frames violates that. Sorry, but take heart in knowing it''s a great capture. :)</td>', 'A really cool and nice shot Melissa. Too bad about the DQ, and I hope they at least gave you a good explanation of how the multiple exposure in camera can be used. Unfortunately it can only be used to increase the dynamic range such as an in camera HDR, but nothing in the scene or frame must change. Your movement through the frames violates that. Sorry, but take heart in knowing it''s a great capture. :)', '2010-06-09 01:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
