(6047595, 887689, 110400, '<td valign="top">Wow...I don''t think I have ever gotten so many votes in the 1,2,3 range before.  I was going for somethnig unique to me and yes, the photo was grainy on purpose.  Was it gimicky?  Probably so, but the whole challenge was self-portrait and that asks the artist how they see themself.  I am a course and grainy person and the picture is appropriate.  Honestly, i don''t think it deserved all the 1-3 votes as that makes it seem like the picture itself is worthless and way below average, but then again it is a personal thing.</td>', 'Wow...I don''t think I have ever gotten so many votes in the 1,2,3 range before.  I was going for somethnig unique to me and yes, the photo was grainy on purpose.  Was it gimicky?  Probably so, but the whole challenge was self-portrait and that asks the artist how they see themself.  I am a course and grainy person and the picture is appropriate.  Honestly, i don''t think it deserved all the 1-3 votes as that makes it seem like the picture itself is worthless and way below average, but then again it is a personal thing.', '2010-06-09 01:31:36.000000', NULL, 0),
