(6048101, 886768, 75034, '<td valign="top">Aw shucks, twernt nothin.<br/> <br/>Of course it was worth it, you got to spend time with me :)<br/> <br/>Leo, I am truly thankful for your friendship and once again I was a part of one of your great photographic ideas. I learn so much form you and I <br/> <br/>will always be here for you to give you a hand with shooting (and building loft beds for your children so you can help me with a photo). I now <br/> <br/>take chances that I never would have with my photography all because you challenge me to push the limits of what I know and the <br/> <br/>equipment I have. You have shown me that there really is no limit to creativity. <br/> <br/>Thank you Leo, you are a great friend.<br/> <br/>If anyone is looking for Leo (or the tub) to do some modeling you can PM me and I''ll see if we can fit you in :)<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Aw shucks, twernt nothin. Of course it was worth it, you got to spend time with me :) Leo, I am truly thankful for your friendship and once again I was a part of one of your great photographic ideas. I learn so much form you and I  will always be here for you to give you a hand with shooting (and building loft beds for your children so you can help me with a photo). I now  take chances that I never would have with my photography all because you challenge me to push the limits of what I know and the  equipment I have. You have shown me that there really is no limit to creativity.  Thank you Leo, you are a great friend. If anyone is looking for Leo (or the tub) to do some modeling you can PM me and I''ll see if we can fit you in :) MAX!', '2010-06-09 10:16:29.000000', NULL, 0),
