(6049489, 887705, 83080, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and it seems silly to me that using a multiple exposure feature in camera is not allowed.  The funny part is that they allow manual multiple exposures with a card over the lens, but don''t allow automation of that process.  Seems like an unnecessary burden on creativity to me.  Nice job anyhow.</td>', 'I like this shot and it seems silly to me that using a multiple exposure feature in camera is not allowed.  The funny part is that they allow manual multiple exposures with a card over the lens, but don''t allow automation of that process.  Seems like an unnecessary burden on creativity to me.  Nice job anyhow.', '2010-06-10 00:00:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6049533, 886768, 97814, '<td valign="top">Wow Leo you rocked this one, what an amazing photo, just fantastic!!!!  Congratulations!  <br/>xo Jo</td>', 'Wow Leo you rocked this one, what an amazing photo, just fantastic!!!!  Congratulations!  xo Jo', '2010-06-10 00:36:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6049539, 886431, 112828, '<td valign="top">I think you should have done better as well.. This isn''t a ribbon shot, but, it''s much better than a 4.75 overall.<br/> <br/>In any case, I think a much sharper eye would have helped set this off..  You have beautiful eyes, accent that and work with your obvious strengths...  I would guess a selective sharpening of the eyes here and a small sat boost to the eyes would have made close to a 1 point difference..  That, and if you would have kept that thing out from in front of your face... Stop hiding and show us your wonderful face!</td>', 'I think you should have done better as well.. This isn''t a ribbon shot, but, it''s much better than a 4.75 overall. In any case, I think a much sharper eye would have helped set this off..  You have beautiful eyes, accent that and work with your obvious strengths...  I would guess a selective sharpening of the eyes here and a small sat boost to the eyes would have made close to a 1 point difference..  That, and if you would have kept that thing out from in front of your face... Stop hiding and show us your wonderful face!', '2010-06-10 00:39:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6049543, 886537, 112828, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by J-Me:</b></div><hr/><i> Yup...smarta$$ look but, VERY well photgraphed!  Nicely done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Looks like I achieved my goal here :)  I must have done a fine job of capturing my personality here..</td>', 'Originally posted by J-Me: Yup...smarta$$ look but, VERY well photgraphed!  Nicely done.   Looks like I achieved my goal here :)  I must have done a fine job of capturing my personality here..', '2010-06-10 00:41:06.000000', NULL, 0),
