(6057353, 887374, 52115, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on that really fast ribbon.<br/>Good composition and many paths for a user to follow in the moody lighting. Such as foreground to background, dark to light. Seems like the camera was probably on a tripod very close to the lamp, right? I''d like to see a rat or mouse walking across the floor.</td>', 'Congratulations on that really fast ribbon.Good composition and many paths for a user to follow in the moody lighting. Such as foreground to background, dark to light. Seems like the camera was probably on a tripod very close to the lamp, right? I''d like to see a rat or mouse walking across the floor.', '2010-06-15 20:12:59.000000', NULL, 0),
