(6068913, 887748, 116649, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by L2:</b></div><hr/><i> This image has a strange color cast that is a bit disconcerting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The image is actually a reflection taken off a brass plaque, thus the color cast.  The "dust" appears where the metal had been burnished off.</td>', 'Originally posted by L2: This image has a strange color cast that is a bit disconcerting.   The image is actually a reflection taken off a brass plaque, thus the color cast.  The "dust" appears where the metal had been burnished off.', '2010-06-24 15:14:23.000000', NULL, 0),
