(6100673, 887542, 24486, '<td valign="top">Brilliant concept. Very cleverly done. This got a chuckle out of me.</td>', 'Brilliant concept. Very cleverly done. This got a chuckle out of me.', '2010-07-22 08:08:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6109180, 886431, 40718, '<td valign="top">Self-portraits are fun, aren''t they?  Well, they CAN be fun anyway.  The main issue with this shot is not your pose or you but the color cast.  It is very red/yellow overall and that keeps your wonderful hair from standing out.  It becomes one more red thing in a host of other red things.</td>', 'Self-portraits are fun, aren''t they?  Well, they CAN be fun anyway.  The main issue with this shot is not your pose or you but the color cast.  It is very red/yellow overall and that keeps your wonderful hair from standing out.  It becomes one more red thing in a host of other red things.', '2010-07-30 01:15:25.000000', NULL, 0);
