(6109881, 886923, 30982, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile, even though you tried not to laugh.  :-)  Good to see you again!</td>', 'This makes me smile, even though you tried not to laugh.  :-)  Good to see you again!', '2010-07-30 21:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6119215, 886929, 58785, '<td valign="top">This is Excellent man. I believe that the original photo copied this one from you instead of the other way LOL<br/> <br/>BTW, I don''t know you well, but you seem like lost weight over the years. You now can fit in one frame LOL<br/> <br/>Leo</td>', 'This is Excellent man. I believe that the original photo copied this one from you instead of the other way LOL BTW, I don''t know you well, but you seem like lost weight over the years. You now can fit in one frame LOL Leo', '2010-08-05 10:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
