(6130177, 887726, 23317, '<td valign="top">Just a fantastic self-portrait.  Such fantastic emotion in this shot.  You''ll treasure this for many years to come and so will your future children (if that''s a road you choose).</td>', 'Just a fantastic self-portrait.  Such fantastic emotion in this shot.  You''ll treasure this for many years to come and so will your future children (if that''s a road you choose).', '2010-08-14 23:13:44.000000', NULL, 0),
