(6259070, 887561, 37845, '<td valign="top">Its amazing what a little time will do. I sit here now, looking at your photo, and marveling at its brilliance. Borrowed idea or not, your execution was perfect. I also look at the date, and I wonder, "why havent I seen this before?", only to notice that I did vote on this during the challenge. I gave you a 7 at the time, which means I liked it back when I was voting, but I wish I could give you a retroactive bump in score. <br/> <br/>Excellent shot.</td>', 'Its amazing what a little time will do. I sit here now, looking at your photo, and marveling at its brilliance. Borrowed idea or not, your execution was perfect. I also look at the date, and I wonder, "why havent I seen this before?", only to notice that I did vote on this during the challenge. I gave you a 7 at the time, which means I liked it back when I was voting, but I wish I could give you a retroactive bump in score.  Excellent shot.', '2010-12-21 21:10:05.000000', NULL, 0),
