(6917777, 887539, 12611, '<td valign="top">oddly enough, this is a photographic website, where we are unmistakably tied to images, but we must ask. are we really defined by our image? are we only what we see, what light is reflected? This makes photography amazing, the concept that it is not reality, just reflected light, and we, ourselves, are so much more!</td>', 'oddly enough, this is a photographic website, where we are unmistakably tied to images, but we must ask. are we really defined by our image? are we only what we see, what light is reflected? This makes photography amazing, the concept that it is not reality, just reflected light, and we, ourselves, are so much more!', '2012-12-01 08:37:39.000000', NULL, 0),
